mmary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering file modifications**\\n\\nI need to open a file to make modifications as the user mentioned supplementing a cover. Since there are two files, I should clarify which one they’re referring to. It would be good to ask them directly. I might provide the found files and inquire about the specific cover text or image they want. It feels a bit ambiguous now, and it’s important to check that I have no prior records related to this.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 查了下，昨天的 HTML 有 2 个：\n\n1. `Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html`\n2. `Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xiaohongshu.html`\n\n你说“补充一个封面”，我现在缺 2 个关键信息，不然容易改错：\n\n- **改哪个文件**\n- **封面内容要什么样**\n\n你直接回我下面这个格式，我就开改：\n\n```text\n文件：1 或 2\n标题：\n副标题：\n风格：极简 / 科技感 / 小红书风 / 杂志感\n是否要封面图：要 / 不要\n封面图素材：上传图片 or 我用纯文字视觉封面\n```\n\n如果你懒得想，我也可以直接给你一个默认版封面：\n- **标题**：OpenClaw 自升级\n- **副标题**：从发现新版本到安全升级的完整流程\n- **风格**：深色科技感\n- **形式**：首屏大标题 + 标签 + 简洁数据点\n\n你只要回一句：**“按默认版直接加到 2”**，我就直接做。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba1b72920c8191a3dffcc779a80936\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":227,"output":352,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22083,"cost":{"input":0.0005675000000000001,"output":0.00528,"cacheRead":0.005376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0112235}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773804394247}}
