没看到读 `~/.ssh`、`MEMORY.md`、系统敏感目录\n  - 没看到可疑下载脚本、混淆代码、sudo、隐蔽外传\n\n**本地验证**\n- 已验证脚本能正常启动，现在缺 key 时会正确提示，不再是路径报错。\n\n**怎么用**\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\nCANGHE_API_KEY='你的key' npm start -- \"小红书封面主题\"\n```\n\n或者：\n\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\nnpm start -- \"小红书封面主题\" \"你的key\"\n```\n\n**提醒一句**\n你刚刚把 key 直接发在聊天里了。虽然这是私聊，我也不会回显它，但**只要这个 key 还有效，建议后面换新 key**，别长期继续用这个。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你：\n1. **用这个 skill 生成一张封面**\n2. **给它补成更像 OpenClaw 原生 skill 的目录结构**\n3. **把调用命令封装成更顺手的一键用法**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba202aeed08191b1905938c182610a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":200,"output":561,"cacheRead":48768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49529,"cost":{"input":0.0005,"output":0.008415,"cacheRead":0.012192,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021107}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773805608246}}
