summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Explaining installed skills**\\n\\nI need to clarify that I can't invoke a slash here, which makes me think the user might be looking to understand my installed skills. It seems like they might have asked about the `/skills` command directly. Since this is a straightforward session, I'll respond succinctly with a list of my available relevant skills to provide the user with the information they're seeking. Keeping it concise should help!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 当前可用/已装的重点 skills，我给你按实用分组列一下：\n\n**内容与文档**\n- `article-to-infographic`：文章转信息图 HTML\n- `summarize`：总结 URL / 文件 / PDF / 音视频\n- `obsidian`：Obsidian 笔记库\n- `wecom-doc`：企业微信文档/智能表格\n- `tencent-docs`：腾讯文档\n- `feishu-doc`：飞书文档\n- `feishu-drive`：飞书云盘\n- `feishu-wiki`：飞书知识库\n\n**技能管理**\n- `clawhub`：公开技能仓库管理\n- `find-skills`：找技能\n- `skill-vetter`：技能安全审查\n- `skill-creator`：创建/整理/审计 skill\n\n**浏览器 / 自动化**\n- `Agent Browser`\n- `tmux`\n\n**媒体生成/处理**\n- `video-frames`\n- `article-to-infographic`\n- **你刚装的** `xiaohongshu-cover-generator`\n  - 路径：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator`\n\n**平台 / 云服务**\n- `tencent-cloud-cos`\n- `tencentcloud-lighthouse-skill`\n- `github`\n\n**生活信息**\n- `weather`\n\n如果你这个 `/skills` 的意思是要我给你看**本地 skills 目录里实际装了哪些**，我也可以马上给你扫一遍真实列表。  \n你回一句：\n\n- **“看本地已安装列表”**\n或\n- **“看全部可用 skill”**\n\n我直接给你完整清单。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba4f71b3a881919eda54c1c265011c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":49894,"output":446,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50340,"cost":{"input":0.12473500000000001,"output":0.00669,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.13142500000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773817705929}}
