27dae19ef70169ba5172406c819187b707be12e49694","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.8_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"~/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.8_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_hono@4.12.8_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":49106,"output":221,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50863,"cost":{"input":0.12276500000000001,"output":0.0033150000000000002,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.12646400000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773818219830}}
{"type":"message","id":"b79a9e0b","parentId":"5d235dbc","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:17:07.738Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vQAPqkyMsWX7mBeXduelYwZ8|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba5172406c819187b707be12e49694","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773818227731}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d939c57","parentId":"b79a9e0b","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:17:18.604Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Searching for skillhub**\n\nI need to search skillhub for each item, possibly combining the results. It seems like running separate searches could give me clearer outputs, so I'm thinking about using exec to perform these searches one by one. This way, I'll have all the information gathered systematically. I want to make sure I get a comprehensive report output, so running them individually might help with organization. Let’s see how to proceed!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517a1fe8819198cd8009225a81a3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpulF91dWiHng4uh9t1CLkcYDI0D2SSVmbtZ8W1ZXEYnyOFz7sTKjbWHvJ6vZsUFl7yIWuwIAEpfS2-npPxXcE_efZq3XayJVB_6erlif5YMMX7Kz7vDo81zXU7W4ZfAjEbmW2Gn9FassBe_78TCGlKR5djECDCt0hY18JoW_bRPRqxjnmu5MkxrV2cpCR_vz7zyhsRv9Vrm_8UWUXc8RMogH4HizVeG10AHh91onfpqxKtwswgclA4BNu9Z7rx8RETW8ZdE4R0ekkEckiHp3oM5B-ZU-7IMPiF3gvjbRWN2dyrBMPunT-70W89FK-X9fH2phK_7zladOtMicVuxP_WZYFFCMYhu2ao_NveJSZwIQiSWlS0HEUCrH2IRnydcxEb9bQ7Hf9Kyl8q0t7a2ayTswUlBYtin9eV5qKSFf66muNOrC0OrBNJLRsayVSNrI0m9TC-goh0IaZvv56-tgMvqLiROolL_lM2NRQ4sgfPbApOJm7VNuOIEUkJbDqC7ihGfpUkvp-OumO06XZ24oWcWe7Yp0kc9-L69n-pJeSJ_RsQMtmZH9QUtW8G_W_kzis6aCsOAwVCE6TeL8x22-A0yh-fOf3iGCaB9zg0PpnyUF0nmvkBlZPwWXMO3DSBT-QVOP6HN0UsDLRowgVjV-IIpn8ylqjJIoXjjzWWJ_zneJ4eiGce7dnZKmsZyOnsX4r3laE_6_21qcWHyDT1bLC3qBiHCzLqTWsswRYyTGL8fTy8KGo70tC2qy58Z9MHQ0onJzvunBjuKJnC90aj3qRKt8jxyOuOeAl0vnwVfREHj15iVT6CyYj-TZ_-0w3gcEku3UicSgu7w_aSL4yApXYRQhGwMUycJtt96DE9S-3MZTw_r8U8nrNSN7jeORViiPTR4vQbp6HBda-3rdtEcbCRL9sL9ZSh3ZtOUMiiBZGkAGNyOnxhgQoVl-4gVatYZAYcbo3jlf4I4luekW_94iAgI8n2qDQCFkKLKwMdaN9OFoPO_YUUYyKQbjYuipzhwiDko1l\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Searching for skillhub**\\n\\nI need to search skillhub for each item, possibly combining the results. It seems like running separate searches could give me clearer outputs, so I'm thinking about using exec to perform these searches one by one. This way, I'll have all the information gathered systematically. I want to make sure I get a comprehensive report output, so running them individually might help with organization. Let’s see how to proceed!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"先按你的规则来：**先用 skillhub 搜**，有命中就优先从那边装；没命中再回退 clawhub。然后我会先做安全审查，再安装。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517d44d88191acd8fb42e7ab4fc4\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_iyzOWQV4tfYomtZUqSFQyTL3|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517e65fc81919f833d45242c5a16","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search \"Tavily Search\"","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"skillhub search \\\"Tavily Search\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_hNCApJsjRu8Af41MzCdg3Sru|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517e660c8191a7fb85c5227a5376","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search \"Multi Search Engine\"","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"skillhub search \\\"Multi Search Engine\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_HrdzEuZCTiWXgS4SdIvAUwAo|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517e661481918c926ead12931cf0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search \"Agent Browser\"","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"skillhub search \\\"Agent Browser\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":628,"output":236,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51552,"cost":{"input":0.0015700000000000002,"output":0.00354,"cacheRead":0.012672,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017782}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773818227734}}
{"type":"message","id":"4bdf7f6b","parentId":"9d939c57","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:17:24.817Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_iyzOWQV4tfYomtZUqSFQyTL3|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517e65fc81919f833d45242c5a16","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nliang-tavily-search  Tavily Search\n  - Web search using Tavily's LLM-optimized API. Returns relevant results with content snippets, scores, and metadata.\n使用Tavily LLM优化API进行网络搜索，返回包含内容片段、评分及元数据的相关结果。\n  - version: 1.0.1\ntavily-search-yourname  Tavily Search\n  - AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\nAI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-darry  Tavily Search\n  - Tavily 搜索 API 集成 | Tavily Search API Integration. 高质量网络搜索、新闻聚合、信息调研 | High-quality web search, news aggregation, research. 触发词：搜索、search、tavily、新闻.\nTavily 搜索 API 集成 | Tavily Search API Integration. 高质量网络搜索、新闻聚合、信息调研 | High-quality web search, news aggregation, research. 触发词：搜索、search、tavily、新闻.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-api  Tavily Search\n  - Tavily API integration with managed API key authentication. Perform AI-powered web search, extract content from URLs, crawl websites, map site structure, and...\nTavily API integration with managed API key authentication. Perform AI-powered web search, extract content from URLs, crawl websites, map site structure, and...\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-websearch  Tavily Search\n  - Search the web using Tavily's Search API. Returns relevant, accurate results with content snippets, scores, and metadata. Use when the user asks to search th...\n  - version: 4.1.0\ntavily-search-pro  Tavily Search Pro\n  - Tavily AI search platform with 5 modes: Search (web/news/finance), Extract (URL content), Crawl (website crawling), Map (sitemap discovery), and Research (deep research with citations). Use for: web search with LLM answers, content extraction, site crawling, deep research.\nTavily AI搜索平台，提供5种模式：搜索(网页/新闻/财经)、提取(URL内容)、爬取(网站)、映射(站点地图)和研究(深度研究带引用)。适用于带LLM答案的网络搜索、内容提取、站点爬取及深度研究。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-1-0-0  Tavily Search 1.0.0\n  - AI-optimized web search using Tavily API providing concise, relevant results and optional deep or topic-specific queries for AI agents.\n基于Tavily API的AI优化搜索，提供简洁相关结果，支持深度或主题定制查询，适用于AI智能体。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-skill  Tavily Search Skill\n  - Tavily API integration with real-time quota management and paid mode toggle. Use when web search is needed.\n集成Tavily API，支持实时配额管理与付费模式切换，用于网络搜索。\n  - version: 1.0.4\ntavily  Tavily AI Search\n  - AI-optimized web search using Tavily Search API. Use when you need comprehensive web research, current events lookup, domain-specific search, or AI-generated answer summaries. Tavily is optimized for LLM consumption with clean structured results, answer generation, and raw content extraction. Best for research tasks, news queries, fact-checking, and gathering authoritative sources.\n基于Tavily Search API的AI优化搜索。适用于综合研究、时事查询、领域搜索及AI摘要生成。针对LLM优化，提供结构化结果与原始内容提取。适合研究、新闻、事实核查及权威资料收集。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-secure  Tavily Search Secure\n  - Tavily API ile güvenli web arama ve URL içerik çıkarma yap. Use when: hızlı web araştırması, kaynaklı sonuç toplama, belirli URL'lerden metin çekme ve özetle...\n使用 Tavily API 进行安全网页搜索与 URL 内容提取。适用于快速网络调研、溯源结果收集、网页文本提取及摘要生成。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-1  Tavily Search 1\n  - AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\nAI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-web-search-for-openclaw  Tavily Web Search Skill for OpenClaw 🦀\n  - use this when the user asks to search the web, look up recent information, check current events, gather online sources, or research a topic using tavily search.\n当用户需要搜索网络、查询最新资讯、了解时事或使用Tavily研究主题时使用。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nirene-tavily  Irene Tavily Search\n  - 使用Tavily API进行智能网络搜索。无需信用卡，每月1000次免费查询。支持AI增强的搜索结果和深度研究模式。Use when: 需要高质量搜索结果、学术研究、或不想绑定信用卡的场景。\n使用Tavily API进行智能网络搜索。无需信用卡，每月1000次免费查询。支持AI增强的搜索结果和深度研究模式。Use when: 需要高质量搜索结果、学术研究、或不想绑定信用卡的场景。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-web  Tavily\n  - Web search and content extraction using Tavily Search/Extract/Research APIs (Bearer auth). Use when you need web results (general/news/finance), date/topic/d...\nWeb search and content extraction using Tavily Search/Extract/Research APIs (Bearer auth). Use when you need web results (general/news/finance), date/topic/d...\n  - version: 0.0.3\ntech-news-daily  Tech News Daily\n  - 获取今日最热门的科技资讯，特别是 AI 大模型领域的最新动态。使用 Tavily Search API 搜索并整理 Top 10 热点新闻，适合每日科技简报、行业资讯收集、AI 领域跟踪等场景。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nai-news-aggregator-sl  AI News Aggregator\n  - Fetches AI & tech news (default) or any custom topic (crypto, geopolitics, etc.) from RSS feeds, Tavily search, Twitter/X, and YouTube. Writes an English edi...\n  - version: 1.2.6\ntavily-search-with-multi-key  Tavily Search with Multi-Key\n  - Web search via Tavily API (alternative to Brave). Use when the user asks to search the web / look up sources / find links and Brave web_search is unavailable...\n  - version: 1.0.0\ninfinite-memory-v2  infinite memory locall rag system for\n  - High-precision memory with 100% recall accuracy for long contexts.\n高精度长上下文记忆，100%准确召回\n  - version: 1.0.0\nlinkfoxagent  LinkFoxAgent\n  - Cross-border e-commerce AI Agent with 41 specialized tools for Amazon/TikTok/eBay/Walmart product research, competitor analysis, keyword tracking, review ins...\n跨境电商AI智能体，配备41个专业工具，支持亚马逊/TikTok/eBay/沃尔玛平台的选品调研、竞品分析、关键词追踪及评论洞察。\n  - version: 1.0.6\nsecure-shopper  Secure Shopper\n  - Asynchronous shopping research + checkout using secure-autofill (1Password-backed browser filling) with results recorded to workspace artifacts.\n通过1Password安全自动填充异步执行购物调研与结账，结果自动记录至工作区产物。\n  - version: 0.1.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6200,"aggregated":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nliang-tavily-search  Tavily Search\n  - Web search using Tavily's LLM-optimized API. Returns relevant results with content snippets, scores, and metadata.\n使用Tavily LLM优化API进行网络搜索，返回包含内容片段、评分及元数据的相关结果。\n  - version: 1.0.1\ntavily-search-yourname  Tavily Search\n  - AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\nAI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-darry  Tavily Search\n  - Tavily 搜索 API 集成 | Tavily Search API Integration. 高质量网络搜索、新闻聚合、信息调研 | High-quality web search, news aggregation, research. 触发词：搜索、search、tavily、新闻.\nTavily 搜索 API 集成 | Tavily Search API Integration. 高质量网络搜索、新闻聚合、信息调研 | High-quality web search, news aggregation, research. 触发词：搜索、search、tavily、新闻.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-api  Tavily Search\n  - Tavily API integration with managed API key authentication. Perform AI-powered web search, extract content from URLs, crawl websites, map site structure, and...\nTavily API integration with managed API key authentication. Perform AI-powered web search, extract content from URLs, crawl websites, map site structure, and...\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-websearch  Tavily Search\n  - Search the web using Tavily's Search API. Returns relevant, accurate results with content snippets, scores, and metadata. Use when the user asks to search th...\n  - version: 4.1.0\ntavily-search-pro  Tavily Search Pro\n  - Tavily AI search platform with 5 modes: Search (web/news/finance), Extract (URL content), Crawl (website crawling), Map (sitemap discovery), and Research (deep research with citations). Use for: web search with LLM answers, content extraction, site crawling, deep research.\nTavily AI搜索平台，提供5种模式：搜索(网页/新闻/财经)、提取(URL内容)、爬取(网站)、映射(站点地图)和研究(深度研究带引用)。适用于带LLM答案的网络搜索、内容提取、站点爬取及深度研究。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-1-0-0  Tavily Search 1.0.0\n  - AI-optimized web search using Tavily API providing concise, relevant results and optional deep or topic-specific queries for AI agents.\n基于Tavily API的AI优化搜索，提供简洁相关结果，支持深度或主题定制查询，适用于AI智能体。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-skill  Tavily Search Skill\n  - Tavily API integration with real-time quota management and paid mode toggle. Use when web search is needed.\n集成Tavily API，支持实时配额管理与付费模式切换，用于网络搜索。\n  - version: 1.0.4\ntavily  Tavily AI Search\n  - AI-optimized web search using Tavily Search API. Use when you need comprehensive web research, current events lookup, domain-specific search, or AI-generated answer summaries. Tavily is optimized for LLM consumption with clean structured results, answer generation, and raw content extraction. Best for research tasks, news queries, fact-checking, and gathering authoritative sources.\n基于Tavily Search API的AI优化搜索。适用于综合研究、时事查询、领域搜索及AI摘要生成。针对LLM优化，提供结构化结果与原始内容提取。适合研究、新闻、事实核查及权威资料收集。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-secure  Tavily Search Secure\n  - Tavily API ile güvenli web arama ve URL içerik çıkarma yap. Use when: hızlı web araştırması, kaynaklı sonuç toplama, belirli URL'lerden metin çekme ve özetle...\n使用 Tavily API 进行安全网页搜索与 URL 内容提取。适用于快速网络调研、溯源结果收集、网页文本提取及摘要生成。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-search-1  Tavily Search 1\n  - AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\nAI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntavily-web-search-for-openclaw  Tavily Web Search Skill for OpenClaw 🦀\n  - use this when the user asks to search the web, look up recent information, check current events, gather online sources, or research a topic using tavily search.\n当用户需要搜索网络、查询最新资讯、了解时事或使用Tavily研究主题时使用。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nirene-tavily  Irene Tavily Search\n  - 使用Tavily API进行智能网络搜索。无需信用卡，每月1000次免费查询。支持AI增强的搜索结果和深度研究模式。Use when: 需要高质量搜索结果、学术研究、或不想绑定信用卡的场景。\n使用Tavily API进行智能网络搜索。无需信用卡，每月1000次免费查询。支持AI增强的搜索结果和深度研究模式。Use when: 需