{"type":"message","id":"22b1d817","parentId":"4c8d478b","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:17:31.452Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_HrdzEuZCTiWXgS4SdIvAUwAo|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba517e661481918c926ead12931cf0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nagent-browser  Agent Browser\n  - A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\n基于Rust的快速无头浏览器自动化CLI，支持Node.js回退，允许AI代理通过结构化命令执行页面导航、点击、输入和快照操作。\n  - version: 0.2.0\nagent-browser-clawdbot  Agent Browser\n  - Headless browser automation CLI optimized for AI agents with accessibility tree snapshots and ref-based element selection\n专为AI智能体优化的无头浏览器自动化CLI，支持无障碍树快照与引用式元素选择\n  - version: 0.1.0\nagent-browser-3  Agent Browser\n  - Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.\n自动化浏览器操作，支持网页测试、表单填写、截图及数据提取。适用于网站导航、页面交互、Web应用测试和信息采集。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nagent-browser-2  Agent Browser\n  - Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.\n自动化浏览器交互，支持网页测试、表单填写、截图和数据提取。适用于网站导航、页面操作及信息采集等场景。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nagent-browser-tekken  Agent Browser\n  - Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.\n自动化浏览器操作，支持网页测试、表单填写、截图和数据提取。用于网站导航、页面交互、Web应用测试及信息抓取。\n  - version: 0.8.6\nagentic-browser  Agent Browser\n  - Browser automation for AI agents via inference.sh. Navigate web pages, interact with elements using @e refs, take screenshots, record video. Capabilities: we...\n通过inference.sh为AI智能体提供浏览器自动化，支持网页导航、@e引用元素交互、截图及录屏。\n  - version: 0.1.5\nagent-browser-4  Agent Browser\n  - Browser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when the user needs to interact with websites, including navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking...\nAI智能体浏览器自动化CLI工具，支持网页导航、表单填写、按钮点击及截图等操作。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nopenclaw-agent-browser  Agent Browser\n  - Headless browser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when interacting with websites — navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking screenshots, ex...\n面向AI智能体的无头浏览器自动化CLI，支持网页导航、表单填写、按钮点击、截图等交互操作。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nws-agent-browser  Agent Browser\n  - 浏览器智能控制。自动化操作、截图、填表、数据抓取。\n浏览器智能控制。自动化操作、截图、填表、数据抓取。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nagent-browser-vercel  Agent Browser\n  - Browser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when the user needs to interact with websites, including navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking...\nBrowser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when the user needs to interact with websites, including navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking...\n  - version: 0.1.0\nagent-browser-core  Agent Browser Core\n  - OpenClaw skill for the agent-browser CLI (Rust-based with Node.js fallback) enabling AI-friendly web automation with snapshots, refs, and structured commands.\n适用于 agent-browser CLI（基于 Rust，Node.js 后备）的 OpenClaw 技能，支持快照、引用和结构化命令，实现 AI 友好的网页自动化。\n  - version: 1.0.1\nagent-browser-stagehand  Agent Browser - Stagehand\n  - Automate web browser interactions using natural language via CLI commands. Use when the user asks to browse websites, navigate web pages, extract data from websites, take screenshots, fill forms, click buttons, or interact with web applications.\n通过自然语言CLI命令自动化浏览器交互，适用于网站浏览、页面导航、数据提取、截图、表单填写及网页应用操作。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nagent-browser-clawdbot-bak-2026-01-28t18-01-09-10-30  A