ght need to install the multi-search-engine, and it could be worth updating the existing tavily and agent-browser tools. I'll need to inspect the current versions and possibly compare them before making any decisions. This way, I can ensure everything is up-to-date and functioning as it should!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_zLYK9fye8hBWcnQ2rakAGggQ|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51c9c7508191a5799fd38bfd23e1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md","offset":1,"limit":40},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":40}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_EgakkMNosA4xcSNtRmynt7nz|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51c9c75c8191b098782a7ace8a9b","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md","offset":1,"limit":30},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":30}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":405,"output":139,"cacheRead":64640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65184,"cost":{"input":0.0010125000000000002,"output":0.002085,"cacheRead":0.01616,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0192575}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773818309457}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e0ef482","parentId":"8b3741ad","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:18:33.991Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_zLYK9fye8hBWcnQ2rakAGggQ|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51c9c7508191a5799fd38bfd23e1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: tavily\ndescription: AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\nhomepage: https://tavily.com\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🔍\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"node\"],\"env\":[\"TAVILY_API_KEY\"]},\"primaryEnv\":\"TAVILY_API_KEY\"}}\n---\n\n# Tavily Search\n\nAI-optimized web search using Tavily API. Designed for AI agents - returns clean, relevant content.\n\n## Search\n\n```bash\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/search.mjs \"query\"\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/search.mjs \"query\" -n 10\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/search.mjs \"query\" --deep\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/search.mjs \"query\" --topic news\n```\n\n## Options\n\n- `-n <count>`: Number of results (default: 5, max: 20)\n- `--deep`: Use advanced search for deeper research (slower, more comprehensive)\n- `--topic <topic>`: Search topic - `general` (default) or `news`\n- `--days <n>`: For news topic, limit to last n days\n\n## Extract content from URL\n\n```bash\nnode {baseDir}/scripts/extract.mjs \"https://example.com/article\"\n```\n\nNotes:\n- Needs `TAVILY_API_KEY` from https://tavily.com\n- Tavily is optimized for AI - returns clean, relevant snippets\n- Use `--deep` for complex research questions\n- Use `--topic news` for current events\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773818313989}}
{"type":"message","id":"b14eedb4","parentId":"1e0ef482","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:18:34.003Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_EgakkMNosA4xcSNtRmynt7nz|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51c9c75c8191b098782a7ace8a9b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: Agent Browser\ndescription: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\nread_when:\n  - Automating web interactions\n  - Extracting structured data from pages\n  - Filling forms programmatically\n  - Testing web UIs\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌐\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"node\",\"npm\"]}}}\nallowed-tools: Bash(agent-browser:*)\n---\n\n# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n### npm recommended\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install\nagent-browser install --with-deps\n```\n\n### From Source\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser\ncd agent-browser\npnpm install\n\n[299 more lines in file. Use offset=31 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773818313994}}
