Search\n- **来源**：skillhub，候选 `liang-tavily-search`\n- **版本**：`1.0.1`\n- **风险信号**：\n  - 需要 `TAVILY_API_KEY`\n  - 会请求 `https://api.tavily.com/search`\n  - 带一个本地脚本 `scripts/search.mjs`\n- **判断**：🟡 中风险，原因是外部 API + key；代码本身很干净\n\n### 2) Multi Search Engine\n- **来源**：skillhub，候选 `multi-search-engine`\n- **版本**：`2.0.1`\n- **风险信号**：\n  - 本体基本是文档/配置，核心是拼搜索 URL\n  - 不需要 API key\n  - 没看到脚本执行和敏感目录访问\n- **判断**：🟢 低风险\n\n### 3) Agent Browser\n- **来源**：skillhub，候选 `agent-browser`\n- **版本**：`0.2.0`\n- **风险信号**：\n  - 需要 `node/npm`\n  - 能驱动浏览器自动化，能力本身较强\n  - 当前 skill 本体主要是说明文档，真正高权限能力来自外部 `agent-browser` CLI\n- **判断**：🟡 中风险，主要是能力范围大，不是因为发现脏代码\n\n补一句：\n- **`tavily-search` 和 `agent-browser` 你本地其实已经有了**\n- 我现在会做的是：**先备份现有目录，再用 skillhub 版本覆盖/补齐**\n- `multi-search-engine` 会新增安装\n\n我开始装。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51d2c3588191a44c2f20a230f0f9\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_W3lgnMkUD22odZlMlBH1GId9|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba51d76e708191a72e20371709965d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"set -e\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace\nmkdir -p skills/.backup\nstamp=$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\nfor d in tavily-search agent-browser; do\n  if [ -d \"skills/$d\" ]; then\n    cp -a \"skills/$d\" \"skills/.backup/${d}-${stamp}\"\n  fi\ndone\nskillhub --dir /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills --skip-self-upgrade install liang-tavily-search\nskillhub --dir /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills --skip-self-upgrade install multi-search-engine\nskillhub --dir /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills --skip-self-upgrade install agent-browser\nprintf '\\nINSTALLED_DIRS\\n'\nfind /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills -maxdepth 1 -mindepth 1 -type d | sed 's#^/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/##' | sort\n","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":180},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"set -e\\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace\\nmkdir -p skills/.backup\\nstamp=$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\\nfor d in tavily-search agent-browser; do\\n  if [ -d \\\"skills/$d\\\" ]; then\\