#### 方案 B：保持现状\n先不动，等你实际用了再决定保留哪个。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你：\n1. **整理重复的 Tavily skill**\n2. **检查这 3 个 skill 是否都能正常调用**\n3. **顺手给你列一个 `/skills` 实际本地安装清单**\n\n你回一句：\n- **“整理重复项”**\n或\n- **“检查可用性”**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba520275e881918dccd41588f197b8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":241,"output":451,"cacheRead":67328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68020,"cost":{"input":0.0006025000000000001,"output":0.006765,"cacheRead":0.016832,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0241995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773818367947}}
