{"type":"message","id":"305f7639","parentId":"6bfab8cb","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:23:52.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Finalizing settings**\n\nI need to make a final mention about the installed programs and the vet report while keeping it concise. Also, it seems I can't set the default browser here, which is a bit of a bummer. It could be an important setting to finalize. Maybe I should double-check if there are any other ways to ensure everything's set up correctly. It’s always good to cover all bases!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba52f7c85c81919fbc447228e77b2a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpulL77CzbKHcbOo-zGhGfYZgnU2sh-RtB6p8YZUeOkt8tUClYxRM4jMy_J-SXvA0oSte2tp_LZiGKEnRwUN0kfOHhlv-DoTRlS1DuSnclvFvCzcl1exN9uCx4KbGYWKE-vhNQfaQqeFmxnY_cV9GTwMrkMZuBsmcqeNtyCMiJrsjfXe3iHNXPU_hz6jociJ15cmb6Tz2c1veJ8s7pNoYZw8f8dSuPTeSMYh2s2rrdldxuCrZJjLPEx0QIyk6WEjvgGb9JhkLmonltbLefP4cEZiDCeVO_Mfmi_44Prf8xLS0LQZykGCFq67fWSzCs9I4wHW7NvVobWrhRQV7GqaCpBMNfnoT7qvTJ7oj3WRpoqpIOdPaHCe95SQ9_6Eww_1OjvbTWwyox-g8vNFtihvAcgoIZMFbWg11EjqZeuSdBLPc4meZeeVnRs76b6aPCYXsIFCK98quU68-Ti35AJHdXUU8UQeQIuNR-HbdaPZE4TcZpLEgBIrTd8s_GBkblBSHWYgAlI2O4k0Jln-lUkxczY-kZbk763tG7tP3Z_X6LOfjhxGh1XGSCKvgd5ljJ9ooWYBZgFOibg13MznJ9aJIgZr54afghBoF01CiHJff8FgRJ6rldoBDUPE8yIxyO-S4neVKJxduhkNrwAOGDdcJJUwCmX0oLKLdT6hUu_JHyT8QEf1-bNTBQ-8xX3VAcpsQYICKymSLaHWMdAiamuMlQ9go4Fl4hM2uS-Bcrm-1Rtpmc5EOEjlLkaM65T9A5W_OdER5qTlFwj7NEGi4qha03Pjd5x48wjamg4FokIMCY9hxk5PgOeLycujoSMLOQnzvR4T3rEQErszZxEQzsSTySnUPjXbV8PGEv5G4R-THHl5UMsvCc7-eOz6e94rk5gUlXkpaRwnfpUtdH3VdXKhWbgDWc6lGhxTkhDnWlQO4Kv_cuH-kVBdQM3e6_ZGTvNHk-NfLP\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Finalizing settings**\\n\\nI need to make a final mention about the installed programs and the vet report while keeping it concise. Also, it seems I can't set the default browser here, which is a bit of a bummer. It could be an important setting to finalize. Maybe I should double-check if there are any other ways to ensure everything's set up correctly. It’s always good to cover all bases!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 装好了，但“设为默认浏览器”这件事我得说清楚：\n\n## 已完成\n### PinchTab 安装结果\n- **CLI 已安装**：`pinchtab 0.8.3`\n- **OpenClaw 插件已安装并加载**\n  - 插件 ID：`pinchtab`\n  - 状态：`loaded`\n\n也就是说，**它现在已经是当前 OpenClaw 环境里的可用浏览器控制插件**了。\n\n---\n\n## 审查结论\n**Source**: GitHub `pinchtab/pinchtab`  \n**Version**:\n- Pinchtab CLI：`0.8.3`\n- OpenClaw plugin：`0.1.0`\n\n**Repo 指标**\n- Stars：**7910**\n- Forks：**586**\n- 最近更新：**2026-03-18**\n- 最近提交里还能看到安全加固：`download SSRF hardening`\n\n**风险等级**：🟡 **中风险**\n\n**原因**\n- 这是个**浏览器控制系统**，能力范围很大\n- 能执行页面导航、点击、输入、截图、JS evaluate\n- 包含 HTTP server / daemon / plugin 三层能力\n- 但我**没看到明显恶意红旗**：\n  - 没看到偷读 `MEMORY.md` / `~/.ssh`\n  - 没看到混淆代码\n  - 没看到偷偷上传本地敏感文件的逻辑\n  - 项目体量大，但方向明确，社区活跃，安全姿态不差\n\n---\n\n## 关于“设置为默认浏览器”\n**我没有直接帮你设。**\n\n原因很简单：\n1. **我当前跑在 Linux 主机里，不是你的 mac 本机**\n2. “默认浏览器”是**目标机器的系统级设置**\n3. 这一步要在**你想设默认浏览器的那台机器**上执行\n\n### 如果你是想在你的 mac 上设默认浏览器\n那要先确认一件事：\n\n**PinchTab 不是传统 GUI 浏览器本体，它本质是浏览器控制层/服务。**  \n所以它**通常不适合作为 macOS 的“默认浏览器 App”** 来承接你平时点链接的系统行为。\n\n**更准确的用法是：**\n- 把 PinchTab 当成 **AI/browser automation runtime**\n- 平时默认浏览器仍然用 Chrome / Arc / Safari / Edge 这类正常桌面浏览器\n\n---\n\n## 我的建议\n### 推荐做法\n- **默认浏览器**：继续用你常用的桌面浏览器\n- **AI 自动化浏览器**：用 PinchTab\n\n这是合理配置。别把“自动化控制层”硬当成“系统默认浏览器”，容易别扭。\n\n---\n\n## 下一步你可以选一个\n1. **我帮你把 PinchTab 跑起来并做一次健康检查**\n2. **我帮你把 OpenClaw 里的 PinchTab 配置补齐**\n3. **如果你坚持要设默认浏览器，我告诉你 mac 上应该怎么判断它能不能被系统识别为浏览器 App**\n\n你回一句：\n- **“跑起来检查”**\n- **“补配置”**\n- **“看默认浏览器方案”**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba52fba2708191924ae46fa376b0c2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3537,"output":757,"cacheRead":78976,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83270,"cost":{"input":0.008842500000000001,"output":0.011355,"cacheRead":0.019743999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0399415}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773818609880}}
