{"type":"message","id":"4e0d5373","parentId":"9b949940","timestamp":"2026-03-18T07:29:46.620Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1ZpIfQCqlAwlsH6ZGNAmFkLY|fc_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba546a50b08191a9eb78c35cf1ddfc","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PinchTab provides a lightweight, API-driven way for AI agents to control\nbrowsers, manage tabs, and perform interactive tasks.\n\nUsage:\n  pinchtab [command] [flags]\n  pinchtab server                # Starts the full server\n\n\nCommands:\n\n  Primary Commands:\n    bridge          Start single-instance bridge-only server\n    daemon          Manage the background service\n    mcp             Start the MCP stdio server\n    server          Start server\n\n  Browser Control:\n    back            Go back in browser history\n    check           Check a checkbox or radio\n    click           Click element\n    dialog          Handle JavaScript dialogs (alert, confirm, prompt)\n    download        Download a file via browser session\n    eval            Evaluate JavaScript\n    fill            Fill input directly\n    find            Find elements by natural language query\n    focus           Focus element\n    forward         Go forward in browser history\n    hover           Hover element\n    keyboard        Keyboard commands (type, inserttext)\n    keydown         Hold a key down\n    keyup           Release a key\n    nav             Navigate to URL\n    network         List or inspect network requests\n    pdf             Export the current page as PDF\n    press           Press key (Enter, Tab, Escape...)\n    quick           Navigate + analyze page\n    reload          Reload current page\n    screenshot      Take a screenshot\n    scroll          Scroll to element or by pixels\n    scrollintoview  Scroll element into view and return bounding box\n    select          Select option in dropdown\n    snap            Snapshot accessibility tree\n    tab             List tabs, or focus a tab by ID\n    text            Extract page text\n    type            Type into element\n    uncheck         Uncheck a checkbox or radio\n    upload          Upload a file to a file input element\n    wait            Wait for element, text, URL, network idle, JS expression, or fixed duration\n\n  Profiles and Instances:\n    activity        List recorded activity events\n    health          Check server health\n    instance        Manage browser instances\n    instances       List or manage instances\n    profiles        List browser profiles\n\n  Configuration & Setup:\n    completion      Generate shell completion script\n    config          Manage configuration\n    security        Review runtime security posture\n\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help            help for pinchtab\n      --server string   PinchTab server URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:{port})\n  -v, --version         version for pinchtab\n\n\nExamples:\n  pinchtab server\n  pinchtab nav https://pinchtab.com"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":51,"aggregated":"PinchTab provides a lightweight, API-driven way for AI agents to control\nbrowsers, manage tabs, and perform interactive tasks.\n\nUsage:\n  pinchtab [command] [flags]\n  pinchtab server                # Starts the full server\n\n\nCommands:\n\n  Primary Commands:\n    bridge          Start single-instance bridge-only server\n    daemon          Manage the background service\n    mcp             Start the MCP stdio server\n    server          Start server\n\n  Browser Control:\n    back            Go back in browser history\n    check           Check a checkbox or radio\n    click           Click element\n    dialog          Handle JavaScript dialogs (alert, confirm, prompt)\n    download        Download a file via browser session\n    eval            Evaluate JavaScript\n    fill            Fill input directly\n    find            Find elements by natural language query\n    focus           Focus element\n    forward         Go forward in browser history\n    hover           Hover element\n    keyboard        Keyboard commands (type, inserttext)\n    keydown         Hold a key down\n    keyup           Release a key\n    nav             Navigate to URL\n    network         List or inspect network requests\n    pdf             Export the current page as PDF\n    press           Press key (Enter, Tab, Escape...)\n    quick           Navigate + analyze page\n    reload          Reload current page\n    screenshot      Take a screenshot\n    scroll          Scroll to element or by pixels\n    scrollintoview  Scroll element into view and return bounding box\n    select          Select option in dropdown\n    snap            Snapshot accessibility tree\n    tab             List tabs, or focus a tab by ID\n    text            Extract page text\n    type            Type into element\n    uncheck         Uncheck a checkbox or radio\n    upload          Upload a file to a file input element\n    wait            Wait for element, text, URL, network idle, JS expression, or fixed duration\n\n  Profiles and Instances:\n    activity        List recorded activity events\n    health          Check server health\n    instance        Manage browser instances\n    instances       List or manage instances\n    profiles        List browser profiles\n\n  Configuration & Setup:\n    completion      Generate shell completion script\n    config          Manage configuration\n    security        Review runtime security posture\n\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help            help for pinchtab\n      --server string   PinchTab server URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:{port})\n  -v, --version         version for pinchtab\n\n\nExamples:\n  pinchtab server\n  pinchtab nav https://pinchtab.com","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773818986611}}
