need to store this in memory. I should focus on providing a concise answer based on the relevant files I have access to. It's important to deliver the information clearly and efficiently without any extra details. Let’s see what I can find regarding the skill setup to help the user!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 需要。\n\n### Tavily Search 这个 skill 需要 API\n它依赖：\n- `TAVILY_API_KEY`\n\n我之前审过的 `tavily-search` / `liang-tavily-search` 都是这个逻辑：\n- 本地脚本读取环境变量 `TAVILY_API_KEY`\n- 然后请求 `https://api.tavily.com/search`\n\n### 不配会怎样\n不设置的话，运行时会直接报错，类似：\n```bash\nError: TAVILY_API_KEY not set\n```\n\n### 你现在要配的就是这个\n最简单方式：\n\n```bash\nexport TAVILY_API_KEY=\"tvly-你的key\"\n```\n\n如果是给 OpenClaw 长期用，更稳的是把它写进配置里对应 skill 的环境或配置项，而不是只在当前 shell export。\n\n### 结论\n- **Tavily Search 需要设置 API**\n- **必须有 `TAVILY_API_KEY` 才能正常用**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你：\n1. **检查当前机器有没有配好 `TAVILY_API_KEY`**\n2. **把 Tavily 配进 OpenClaw**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8f2527dae19ef70169ba573ffbb881919dbee116286e245b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":492,"output":300,"cacheRead":94720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95512,"cost":{"input":0.0012300000000000002,"output":0.0045000000000000005,"cacheRead":0.02368,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02941}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773819705480}}
